INSERT INTO `lms_jobs` VALUES ('job_013a4da7fb09b552','013a4da7fb09b55294a55a08af45e5a4','Uber Tech Mobility','https://cdn.simpleicons.org/uber/000000','Machine Learning Engineer - Demand Forecasting & Dynamic Pricing','Data Science & AI','Hyderabad / Hybrid','Hybrid','₹36 - ₹52 LPA','2-5 YOE','[\"Python\",\"XGBoost\",\"TensorFlow\",\"Spark\",\"MLOps\",\"Kafka\"]',1,'https://www.uber.com/careers','2 days ago','Build and deploy real-time marketplace demand forecasting models processing billions of geospatial telemetry events.','[\"Strong background in statistical modeling, time-series forecasting, and machine learning.\",\"Experience scaling feature stores and real-time inference pipelines with Apache Spark/Flink.\",\"Proficiency in Python data science ecosystems (NumPy, Pandas, Scikit-learn, PyTorch).\"]',NULL,NULL,'Custom',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_0310ae8b8e30edff','0310ae8b8e30edff9eac1b6ed529152a','Jitterbit','https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/12me7oz3rekq6u2uo23r0j8r1ucn','Senior Software Engineer - Backend - Remote','DevOps & SRE','Remote','Remote','₹34 - ₹55 LPA','4-8 YOE','[\"Java 21\",\"AWS Cloud\",\"DynamoDB\",\"Apache Kafka\",\"Microservices\"]',1,'https://himalayas.app','21/1/1970','About the team: At Jitterbit , engineering is at the heart of everything we do. We take pride in writing high-quality, maintainable code and delivering a world-class user experience. Our team is collaborative, driven, and embraces a remote-first culture designed for productivity and innovation. You’ll work closely with engineers, product managers, and operations to push the boundaries of what’s possible in enterprise integration. We value curiosity, ownership, and continuous learning. About the role: As a Senior Backend Engineer, you’ll play a key role in designing and developing new features for our iPaaS and APIM platform. You\'ll work with a modern and diverse tech stack, including: Languages & Frameworks: Java, C++, Lua I nfrastructure & DevOps: Docker, Kubernetes, Linux, Nginx, Tomcat, Apache Data & Messaging: MySQL, SQL Server, Redis, Kafka, Elasticsearch, InfluxDB Cloud Services: AWS (S3, CloudFront, DynamoDB) You’ll take ownership of projects from design through deployment, ensuring scalability, reliability, and performance in a 24x7x365 environment. This is a high-impact role offering the opportunity to work on cutting-edge technologies and help shape the future of integrat','[\"We take pride in writing high-quality, maintainable code and delivering a world-class user experience.\",\"Familiar with application deployment via Docker and/or Kubernetes.\",\"Hands-on experience with AWS services such as DynamoDB, S3, or CloudFront.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Himalayas',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_03e53e90ca1692a6','03e53e90ca1692a6e808e0543d74210d','Humana','https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/1g3s0vd2kg0b6yshyfzsrs0lta7u','Transition Coordinator','Full Stack & Core','Remote','Remote','$59300 - $80900','0-2 YOE','[]',1,'https://himalayas.app','21/1/1970','Become a part of our caring community The Transition Coordinator (Care Coach 2) evaluates member\'s needs. This evaluation aims to achieve or maintain an wellness state. The Coordinator guides members/families toward resources and facilitates interaction with them. These resources are appropriate for the care and wellbeing of members. The Care Coach 2 work assignments are varied and frequently require interpretation and independent determination of the appropriate courses of action. Position Responsibilities: Support the ongoing member transitions in and out of the Indiana Medicaid programs, the Contractor\'s enrollment, and among care settings. Helps prepare for transitions and follows up on care after completing transitions. The Member Advocate Coordinator and other member-focused departments of the plan work together to ensure continuity and coordination of care. This collaboration also facilitates member and provider communication through the initial transition, ongoing benefit plan, and MCE transfers. Ensure the transfer and receipt of all outstanding prior authorization decisions, utilization management data, and clinical information such as prevention and wellness programs(s),','[\"Become a part of our caring community The Transition Coordinator (Care Coach 2) evaluates member\'s needs.\",\"This evaluation aims to achieve or maintain an wellness state.\",\"The Coordinator guides members/families toward resources and facilitates interaction with them.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Himalayas',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_047d43cf788841de','047d43cf788841de5da2625105cf7ae0','Panzer Technologies Pvt Ltd','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C560BAQGgv4c0AeKt3w/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1658423506672/panzer_technologies_pvt_ltd_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=XLPAzI4Z4lMqGDZEKwADnrD4dSvQzVAaVpCNVFhSYtA','DevOps Engineer I – AWS &amp; AI','Data Science & AI','Pune City, Maharashtra, India','Onsite','₹24 - ₹38 LPA','1-3 YOE','[\"AWS Cloud\"]',1,'https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/devops-engineer-i-%E2%80%93-aws-ai-at-panzer-technologies-pvt-ltd-4462926191','10 hours ago','Exciting opportunity for DevOps Engineer I – AWS & AI at Panzer Technologies Pvt Ltd. Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers. Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.','[\"Exciting opportunity for DevOps Engineer I – AWS & AI at Panzer Technologies Pvt Ltd.\",\"Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers.\",\"Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.\"]',NULL,NULL,'LinkedIn',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 18:40:07'),('job_048459667f254a66','048459667f254a666256febbc395430d','Adobe Creative Cloud','https://cdn.simpleicons.org/adobe/FF0000','Full Stack Engineer - Collaboration & Cloud Documents','Full Stack & Core','Noida / Hybrid','Hybrid','₹24 - ₹36 LPA','1-3 YOE','[\"TypeScript\",\"Node.js\",\"React\",\"WebSockets\",\"GraphQL\",\"AWS\"]',1,'https://adobe.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com','6 days ago','Power real-time multi-user canvas collaboration and cloud document synchronization across web and desktop apps.','[\"Strong skills in modern TypeScript, React, and asynchronous state synchronization (CRDTs/OT).\",\"Experience with WebSockets, GraphQL, and serverless cloud architectures on AWS.\",\"Focus on UI performance, sub-50ms latency, and seamless UX.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Custom',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_07108466dace018b','07108466dace018b7220203bdd17f607','TalentXO','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C560BAQHjmNLNPg59Pw/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1630652839712/talentxo_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=73VuKMm0Zo_Q-tV33QRS6FjODORvrcC62KLrpY6lgmQ','Data Scientist / AI Engineer (Python, ML, RAG)','Data Science & AI','Pune Division, Maharashtra, India','Onsite','₹24 - ₹38 LPA','1-3 YOE','[\"Python 3.12\",\"RAG Architecture\"]',1,'https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/data-scientist-ai-engineer-python-ml-rag-at-talentxo-4464314853','6 hours ago','Exciting opportunity for Data Scientist / AI Engineer (Python, ML, RAG) at TalentXO. Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers. Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.','[\"Exciting opportunity for Data Scientist / AI Engineer (Python, ML, RAG) at TalentXO.\",\"Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers.\",\"Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.\"]',NULL,NULL,'LinkedIn',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 18:39:53'),('job_0843f872b93c4b77','0843f872b93c4b7760c773e209881051','Coalition Technologies','https://remotive.com/job/1680495/logo','Remote Office Assistant','Full Stack & Core','Worldwide','Remote','$31,2k- $52k','0-2 YOE','[\"CSS\",\"excel\",\"frontend\",\"git\",\"html\",\"illustrator\",\"magento\",\"photoshop\",\"php\",\"shopify\",\"wordpress\",\"MySQL\",\"startup\",\"responsive\",\"themes\",\"bootstrap\",\"insurance\",\"jQuery\",\"Ajax\"]',1,'https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/marketing/remote-office-assistant-1680495','11/8/2026','Coalition Technologies is seeking a reliable, detail-oriented, and highly organized Remote Office Assistant to support administrative, bookkeeping, billing, reporting, data entry, and internal operations tasks. This role is ideal for someone with strong communication skills, discretion, attention to detail, and a willingness to learn and grow within a fast-paced remote work environment. As an Office Assistant, you will help support daily administrative operations, assist with entry-level bookkeeping, organize client documents, support internal reporting, and help maintain accurate company records. This position offers strong growth potential for the right candidate, including opportunities for advancement within the Accounting team or other departments. We are looking for talented and diligent candidates who perform well on our skills assessments. Strong skills test performance may be considered even if a candidate does not meet every preferred experience or educational background requirement. Why Join Coalition Technologies? Coalition Technologies is committed to delivering high-quality work for our clients while providing our team with a fun, thriving, innovative, and growth-focu','[\"This role is ideal for someone with strong communication skills, discretion, attention to detail, and a willingness to learn and grow within a fast-paced remote work environment.\",\"We are looking for talented and diligent candidates who perform well on our skills assessments.\",\"Strong skills test performance may be considered even if a candidate does not meet every preferred experience or educational background requirement.\",\"Compensation may vary based on factors such as experience, qualifications, skills test performance, geographic location, and seniority of the position offered.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Remotive',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_0aade173820d145f','0aade173820d145f02d967d835088e3c','Ecoplanet Green Operations Gmbh','https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Ecoplanet%20Green%20Operations%20Gmbh&background=4F46E5&color=fff&bold=true&size=128','Data Engineer (m/f/d)','Data Science & AI','München','Hybrid','₹38 - ₹60 LPA','4-8 YOE','[\"Data Engineering\"]',1,'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/ecoplanet-green-operations-gmbh/data-engineer-munchen-393656','7/9/2026','What we are building At ecoplanet, we\'re redefining energy for tomorrow. Our mission: turn energy management into the competitive edge every European business relies on to win its market. We\'re building the operating system for the energy transition — cutting energy costs, improving efficiency, and streamlining operations. Backed by EQT Ventures, HV Capital and more, and built by a team full of top-tier talent. Why This Role Matters You will build and run the data backbone the whole product sits on. Meter readings arrive from industrial sites across Europe, through messages or us accessing APIs. Your job is to get that data in clean, on time, and in a shape that dashboards, insights and forecasts can rely on. You will join a team of 12 engineers in two squads. Small team, real ownership, and what you build reaches customers in weeks rather than quarters. What You’ll Achieve Meter data integration. Connect industrial hardware and utility data streams into real-time dashboards. Every site is a little different, so a good part of the job is bringing data into a consistent structure across all sites Anomalies and insights. This is where data science comes in. Find the things in the dat','[\"What we are building At ecoplanet, we\'re redefining energy for tomorrow.\",\"Our mission: turn energy management into the competitive edge every European business relies on to win its market.\",\"We\'re building the operating system for the energy transition — cutting energy costs, improving efficiency, and streamlining operations.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Arb