euerung und Umsetzung verschiedener strategischer und operativer Maßnahmen im Glasfaserausbau.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Arbeitnow',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_0ed8943ba6177946','0ed8943ba6177946916e42a4d2661ad1','F5','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQHF1zS0EyAQuA/company-logo_100_100/B56Zgu0CSMHkAc-/0/1753132050229/f5_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=uSJj6fn3B7zPBwIZg4CiTqkfeJqLxcGMBrCeKoEU3wA','Cloud Infrastructure / Platform Engineer','DevOps & SRE','Hyderabad, Telangana, India','Onsite','₹22 - ₹36 LPA','1-3 YOE','[\"AWS Cloud\"]',1,'https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/cloud-infrastructure-platform-engineer-at-f5-4455240354','2 hours ago','Exciting opportunity for Cloud Infrastructure / Platform Engineer at F5. Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers. Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.','[\"Exciting opportunity for Cloud Infrastructure / Platform Engineer at F5.\",\"Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers.\",\"Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.\"]',NULL,NULL,'LinkedIn',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 18:45:09'),('job_100f316f6012ff3a','100f316f6012ff3ac453019675630a16','Tanso','https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Tanso&background=4F46E5&color=fff&bold=true&size=128','Senior Software Engineer (f/m/x)','Data Science & AI','Munich','Hybrid','₹38 - ₹60 LPA','4-8 YOE','[\"TypeScript\",\"Go\"]',1,'https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/tanso/senior-software-engineer-munich-15675','7/9/2026','Become part of Tanso and decarbonize industries with us. What if the impact of your role extended beyond a job title? Not through marketing spin. Not through vague \"purpose-driven\" messaging. But through software that helps industrial companies understand, manage and actively reduce their environmental impact. That\'s what Tanso is building. And it\'s one of the reasons people join us. Why Tanso? Take Action in a Fast-Moving, High-Impact Environment.