ties, while also working hands-on with LLMs to solve real user problems and drive product innovation.\",\"Develop infrastructure for model serving, monitoring, logging, and automated evaluation to ensure high reliability and performance of AI services in production.\",\"Optimize platform performance, scalability, and cost-efficiency, leveraging cloud-native technologies and distributed systems.\",\"Collaborate cross-functionally with product, frontend, and data teams to deliver seamless, reliable, and user-centric AI experiences.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Jobicy',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_4267920aab3c08af','4267920aab3c08afad0adfd70baaea6f','Credit Wellness, LLC','https://remotive.com/job/2086540/logo','Inside Sales Contractor','Full Stack & Core','Worldwide','Remote','OTE $25k - $35k','0-2 YOE','[\"CRM\",\"google sheets\",\"financial services\",\"Inside Sales\"]',1,'https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/sales/inside-sales-contractor-2086540','8/8/2026','About Us We are a financial services start up focusing on helping to improve consumer credit profiles. We are currently seeking KPI driven sales representatives looking to earn up to 45K in their first year while working remotely. We offer comprehensive training and continuous sales coaching to help you meet your financial goals. During our training period we offer a guaranteed training stipend while our trainees are acclimating to the position (*see weekly pay below). If you are a seasoned sales professional looking for the autonomy of a remote position combined with great compensation, we want to hear from you! Compensation Structure This role is 100% commission-based , which means your earning potential is unlimited. In addition, we regularly offer competitive performance-based bonuses to reward hard work and results. Training Period (Weeks 1–4) We invest in your success and want to make sure you’re supported as you get up to speed: Week 1: Commission-only (a chance to start earning right away while learning the ropes). Weeks 2–4: Guaranteed training stipend of $500 USD total – or your commission if it’s higher. You’ll always receive whichever amount benefits you most. Week 0: U','[\"We are looking for team members who are: Tech savvy with the ability to navigate digital tools such as SLACK, CRM software, google sheets, etc.\",\"Growth oriented and always looking to learn and acquire new skills.\",\"Team players with the ability to implement feedback from their sales coaches.\",\"Outgoing with outstanding rapport building and active listening skills.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Remotive',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_44e87462e7517e5f','44e87462e7517e5fe242497d737e9988','Infosys','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQEv67uGFge5Sw/company-logo_100_100/B56ZfEsEVpHoAU-/0/1751351576332/infosys_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=cZJHsfAqzeMJNdxHldoUAVht2bRr9_VtbB2VlJJn19I','Platform Architect - Senior Cloud, DevOps Engineer - DaAI','DevOps & SRE','Bengaluru East, Karnataka, India','Onsite','₹34 - ₹55 LPA','4-8 YOE','[\"AWS Cloud\"]',1,'https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/platform-architect-senior-cloud-devops-engineer-daai-at-infosys-4444859131','5 hours ago','Exciting opportunity for Platform Architect - Senior Cloud, DevOps Engineer - DaAI at Infosys. Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers. Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.','[\"Exciting opportunity for Platform Architect - Senior Cloud, DevOps Engineer - DaAI at Infosys.\",\"Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers.\",\"Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.\"]',NULL,NULL,'LinkedIn',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_46032e916a8adaec','46032e916a8adaecb6bae325f6cea37b','Nextiva','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQFufumPcr_vhA/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1709925527924/nextiva_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=R2u2x20YG5HsNUSlI7mgAuu_0iF62JR_k7ig7IGDzSY','Staff Site R