S Cloud\",\"Python 3.12\",\"Terraform\",\"PostgreSQL / MySQL\"]',1,'https://himalayas.app','21/1/1970','Ready to be a Titan? Play a pivotal role as a Data Infrastructure Administrator. Enterprise Data Administration is part of the Data Services team. We build solutions for various enterprise use cases including analytics, data science, and financial reporting. We want data to be at the core of everything that the company does. This is an exciting role for an administrator to come in the rapidly growing company. We build for perfection, use the most modern tools, have an amazing culture, and love to solve complex problems. If you share the same values, you might find yourself in a perfect company. We also desire those who can balance rapid iteration and development with high product quality expectations and who are innovative and comfortable with ambiguity. What you\'ll do Admin & Govern our tech stack centered on Snowflake: You will design and maintain our Snowflake environment, managing everything from Users, RBAC (Role-Based Access Control) to warehouse scaling strategies. Admin and Govern our other technologies including FiveTran, DataBricks, DBT, Airflow,, and Monte Carlo. Optimize Performance: identify bottleneck queries in Snowflake and inefficiencies in our other technologies. ','[\"It’s about the experiences we have, people we meet, and the perspectives we share.\",\"So, if you have the skills but are hesitant to apply because of your background, apply anyway.\",\"These tools are designed to improve efficiency and enhance the candidate experience.\",\"We believe that the convergence of fresh perspectives and experiences from all walks of life is what makes our product and culture so great.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Himalayas',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_48ca0a54886bfee7','48ca0a54886bfee791e6a3d16e7b447c','IAPWE','https://remotive.com/job/1185979/logo','Freelance Writer','Full Stack & Core','Worldwide','Remote','$50-$75 /hour','0-2 YOE','[\"REST\"]',1,'https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/writing/freelance-writer-1185979','4/9/2026','Our organization is seeking content writers to create articles and blog posts on a variety of topics. The rate of pay is $20 per 100 words (this comes out to approximately $100 per article or $50 per hour). Some topics you may be asked to write about include the following (you can always turn down a topic if you do not feel comfortable writing about it, however if you have experience or expertise in a specific area, please let us know): Health & beauty Fitness Home Decor Fashion Sports Do it yourself Finance Legal Medical Family/Parenting Relationships Real Estate Restaurants Contracting (plumbing, pool building, remodeling, etc.) These are just some of the more general industries and topics that we cover. Requirements : We ask that all work be completed using a word processor such as Microsoft Word or Open Office A reliable internet connection and the ability to meet deadlines Good communication skills and respond in a timely manner to editorial staff when they ask for updates on tasks, etc Work well as a team member with the rest of our content management and editorial staff Note : Applicants to this job signaled that accessing some writing tasks may require payment.','[\"Our organization is seeking content writers to create articles and blog posts on a variety of topics.\",\"The rate of pay is $20 per 100 words (this comes out to approximately $100 per article or $50 per hour).\"]',NULL,NULL,'Remotive',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_4a4627492c31113a','4a4627492c31113acbfb600fb6321cfb','OXG Glasfaser GmbH','https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=OXG%20Glasfaser%20GmbH&background=4F46E5&color=fff&bold=true&size=128','(Senior) Projekt- und Prozessmanager Customer Activation (m/w/d)','Full Stack & Core','Düsseldorf und Remote','Hybrid','₹12 - ₹18 LPA','0-2 YOE','[\"Projektmanagement\",\"Customer Activation\",\"Fiber\",\"Glasfaser\",\"Kundenaktivierung\",\"Prozessma