ps looking for a remote job that lets you show your skills and get decent compensation?\",\"We\'re seeking a DevOps Engineer with strong Laravel and Nuxt experience to manage and improve our application infrastructure.\",\"Clear and effective communication in English — advanced ability to discuss business tasks, justify decisions, and communicate issues.\",\"Strong self-organizational skills — ability to work full-time remotely with no supervision.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Remotive',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_4d276c5de151f4d7','4d276c5de151f4d7401e52b4c577d760','Housecall Pro','https://jobicy.com/data/server-nyc0409/galaxy/mercury/2025/06/870ed960-221.jpg','Software Engineer II - Poland','Data Science & AI','Poland','Remote','₹24 - ₹38 LPA','Senior','[\"MySQL\"]',1,'https://jobicy.com/jobs/152625-software-engineer-ii-poland','6/9/2026','Why Housecall Pro? Help us build solutions that build better lives. At Housecall Pro, we show up to work every day to make a difference for real people: the home service professionals that support America’s 100 million homes. We’re all about the Pro, and dedicate our days to helping them streamline operations, scale their businesses, and—ultimately—save time so they can be with their families and live well. While our headquarters are based in Denver, Colorado, our team spans the globe, with teammates across Brazil, Poland, the Philippines, Mexico, and beyond. We care deeply about our customers and foster a culture where our company, people and Pros grow and succeed together—no matter where they’re based. Leadership is as focused on growing team members’ careers as they expect their teams to be on creating solutions for Pros. We also offer: 100% remote work Paid holidays and flexible, take-it-as-you-need-it scheduled time off A culture built on innovation that values big ideas, no matter where they come from A MacBook set up and ready from day one, plus a $500 stipend to design your ideal workspace Central European Time (CET) hours to support a balanced schedule for our Poland-based','[\"The API team owns and improves the backend API layer that powers the Housecall Pro application, with a strong current focus on application performance and creating a fast, reliable user experience.\",\"In this role, you will elevate team effectiveness by sharing knowledge, contributing to design and code reviews.\",\"Your impact will help strengthen our product, enhance user experiences, and support the long-term success of the people we serve.\",\"We offer support in the learning process, tailored to your needs and any prior experience with Ruby.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Jobicy',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 18:46:43'),('job_4e858b572d8a6f91','4e858b572d8a6f91afddaa91d5eb45e0','Amazon Web Services (AWS)','https://cdn.simpleicons.org/amazon/FF9900','Software Development Engineer II (SDE 2) - Distributed Systems','Full Stack & Core','Bengaluru / Hybrid','Hybrid','₹34 - ₹48 LPA','2-5 YOE','[\"Java 21\",\"Spring Boot\",\"AWS DynamoDB\",\"Kafka\",\"Microservices\"]',1,'https://amazon.jobs','1 day ago','Design and build massive scale event-driven backend systems powering AWS cloud infrastructure with 99.999% availability SLAs.','[\"Strong proficiency in core Java (Java 17/21) & Spring Boot microservices.\",\"Experience with distributed datastores, concurrency, and message brokers (Kafka/SQS).\",\"Solid foundations in system design, CAP theorem, and low-latency API architecture.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Custom',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_4fd66cab0cfbf522','4fd66cab0cfbf522d29acb8753403514','Stripe Payments','https://cdn.simpleicons.org/stripe/635BFF','Cloud Infrastructure & Platform Security Engineer','DevOps & SRE','Bengaluru / Remote','Remote','₹40 - ₹60 LPA','4-8 YOE','[\"AWS\",\"Kubernetes\",\"Ansible\",\"Terraform\",\"Go\",\"Zero Trust TLS\"]',1,'https://stripe.com/jobs','3 days ago','Harden payment gateway boundary infrastructure and enforce zero-trust network segregation across multi