the role will depend on a number of factors, including the candidate\'s qualifications, skills, competencies, location and experience, and may fall outside of the range shown.\",\"If you need a reasonable accommodation due to a disability during the application or recruiting process, please contact Recruiting@Tenable.com for further assistance.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Jobicy',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_6ba2a25766b8db43','6ba2a25766b8db432103d06c0b4a6545','Tata Consultancy Services','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGsGR9p4ikS5w/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1708946550425/tata_consultancy_services_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=P-PkUMh7Ks1GQY0_l7GhzQiwfyLfQpvKWwX8Tq18Yc4','Java Backend Developer','Java & Cloud','Bengaluru, Karnataka, India','Onsite','₹20 - ₹34 LPA','1-3 YOE','[\"Java 21\"]',1,'https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/java-backend-developer-at-tata-consultancy-services-4462939881','7 hours ago','Exciting opportunity for Java Backend Developer at Tata Consultancy Services. Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers. Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.','[\"Exciting opportunity for Java Backend Developer at Tata Consultancy Services.\",\"Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers.\",\"Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.\"]',NULL,NULL,'LinkedIn',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_6bde74ecc09571fb','6bde74ecc09571fb2e9df26f9029b767','Walmart Global Tech India','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQEC3n4yU_w6bQ/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1630541053165/walmartglobaltechindia_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=KB5uAZVI1HRhFi7_oz2n8i2VD4Sx9DcqRNE-fpD1_zY','STAFF, SOFTWARE ENGINEER','Full Stack & Core','Chennai, Tamil Nadu, India','Onsite','₹28 - ₹45 LPA','4-8 YOE','[]',1,'https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/staff-software-engineer-at-walmart-global-tech-india-4398461898','9 hours ago','Exciting 