ail address as your pri','[\"The project compensation rate is $0.55 USD per accepted image.\",\"The focus is on capturing real-world variation across lighting, poses, expressions, accessories, environments, and aging to improve model accuracy and robustness.\",\"The collection includes: • Current Neutral Selfies – clean frontal selfies serving as high-quality identity references, with natural variation in appearance and surroundings.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Remotive',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_6ea24123f3e40cf2','6ea24123f3e40cf27dd722f500435c6e','Bqarlson Software Technologies Private Limited','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D0BAQGbzwpDhckk-Q/company-logo_100_100/B4DaB9HuN.IQAI-/0/1788805571868/https_wwwlinkedincom_company_93846053_admin_dashboard__logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=NoTgo6tUlMeWXDRZ0R-Sy9KkmQnfIfQ-vAciR3q95T8','Java Developer','Java & Cloud','Pune District, Maharashtra, India','Onsite','₹20 - ₹34 LPA','1-3 YOE','[\"Java 21\"]',1,'https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/java-developer-at-bqarlson-software-technologies-private-limited-4461892011','11 hours ago','Exciting opportunity for Java Developer at Bqarlson Software Technologies Private Limited. Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers. Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.','[\"Exciting opportunity for Java Developer at Bqarlson Software Technologies Private Limited.\",\"Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers.\",\"Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.\"]',NULL,NULL,'LinkedIn',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_6fbaba193a98d7c3','6fbaba193a98d7c36c6bdd78399ce4a6','HP','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQEJUaQAv2kVcQ/company-logo_100_100/B56ZViAo6QHoAQ-/0/1741106089999/hp_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=CkdW_qlJsnivIFSCyd5feJoXKhIdCpFl9I1hK55yfQU','Cloud Automation & Platform Engineer','Full Stack & Core','Bengaluru, Karnataka, India','Onsite','₹18 - ₹28 LPA',