ing AI’s benefits accessible to society. They’re active contributors to open-source AI research and are looking for researchers and engineers to help build the next generation of AI infrastructure.Cooperation: This starts as contract work via our platform. If it goes well, you’ll transition to a direct hire, with equity, health insurance, and other competitive benefits. Locations: the EU, the US, Canada, the UK, Australia, Singapore About the role: You’d build the Go-based platform that lets research and inference teams provision, scale, repair, and tear down GPU clusters through an API - instead of filing tickets. You’d own the product end to end : shaping internal platforms, improving developer exper','[\"Are you a talented Senior Developer looking for a remote job that lets you show your skills and get decent compensation?\",\"You’d own the product end to end : shaping internal platforms, improving developer experience, and operating the systems in production.\",\"Clear and effective communication in English — advanced ability to discuss business tasks, justify decisions, and communicate issues.\",\"Strong self-organizational skills — ability to work full-time remotely with no supervision.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Remotive',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_9c48fa2b2c5df324','9c48fa2b2c5df324c3c02b04f73eb6f7','QuantumBlack, AI by McKinsey','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C560BAQG12pQe_GvUbQ/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1651050740774/quantumblack_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=LsjC3n_z0oZwm3edrcHQ5HFJG4Mfz3r05TxYLgeXWR8','Principal Forward Deployed Engineer - QuantumBlack, AI by McKinsey','Data Science & AI','Bengaluru, Karnataka, India','Onsite','₹38 - ₹60 LPA','4-8 YOE','[]',1,'https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/principal-forward-deployed-engineer-quantumblack-ai-by-mckinsey-at-quantumblack-ai-by-mckinsey-4411726299','8 hours ago','Exciting opportunity for Principal Forward Deployed Engineer - QuantumBlack, AI by McKinsey at QuantumBlack