elopment','[\"The Clinical Scientist serves as a key clinical development team member, providing hands-on oversight of protocol execution, medical data review, and clinical data quality to enable high-quality, decision-ready data.\",\"Actual salary will vary based on several factors including but not limited to, relevant skills, experience, and qualifications.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Himalayas',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_d48a49c95c87beac','d48a49c95c87beac43b932e5795dcc24','Bristlecone','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQFQApQTe8Dicg/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1632245901852/bristlecone_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=xXZdRZnQscuAkcvEjl9LppjoQlnrx8FMDNCz6U9jPZU','Senior Software Engineer - Cloud &amp; Application Engineering','Full Stack & Core','Pune Division, Maharashtra, India','Onsite','₹28 - ₹45 LPA','4-8 YOE','[\"AWS Cloud\"]',1,'https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/senior-software-engineer-cloud-application-engineering-at-bristlecone-4227030655','1 hour ago','Exciting opportunity for Senior Software Engineer - Cloud & Application Engineering at Bristlecone. Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers. Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.','[\"Exciting opportunity for Senior Software Engineer - Cloud & Application Engineering at Bristlecone.\",\"Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers.\",\"Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.\"]',NULL,NULL,'LinkedIn',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 18:39:53'),('job_d4c6a6c8e05e85da','d4c6a6c8e05e85da45ebec90fe19358d','EXL','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQHZga8kSwpMTQ/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1719841183720/exl_service_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=vBbccDV9YZNetkoDlQixz0h-eanSE2WmEcG7rKcur58','Data Scientist','Data Science & AI','Noida, Uttar Pradesh, India','Onsite','₹24 - ₹38 LPA','1-3 YOE','[]',1,'https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/data-scientist-at-exl-4462