h internal and external customers.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Himalayas',1,'2026-09-07 18:45:09','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_df02466bc3cf6542','df02466bc3cf65420eb1aba62a39685d','Xylem','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E0BAQH4GsXAQOn8KA/company-logo_100_100/B4EZWwgejcHMAQ-/0/1742423059000/xylem_inc_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=0lbC4b1Jroc6TiP4pmvyWHVEtvi7iT2mGe7gs5l0m74','Java Backend Developer with basic AWS knowledge','Java & Cloud','Greater Chennai Area','Onsite','₹20 - ₹34 LPA','1-3 YOE','[\"Java 21\",\"AWS Cloud\"]',1,'https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/java-backend-developer-with-basic-aws-knowledge-at-xylem-4260094537','9 hours ago','Exciting opportunity for Java Backend Developer with basic AWS knowledge at Xylem. Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers. Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.','[\"Exciting opportunity for Java Backend Developer with basic AWS knowledge at Xylem.\",\"Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers.\",\"Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.\"]',NULL,NULL,'LinkedIn',1,'2026-09-07 18:45:09','2026-09-07 18:45:09'),('job_df86d97f2f71945a','df86d97f2f71945a54cdec33f52f0eae','Recro','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQH7GYOGBCj8Qg/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1728907260215/recro_io_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=898rSyj182aC0vqi5cZqbWQQIDumt_WpercCJsH_-TY','Senior Data Scientist','Data Science & AI','Mumbai, Maharashtra, India','Onsite','₹38 - ₹60 LPA','4-8 YOE','[]',1,'https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/senior-data-scientist-at-recro-4462910671','13 hours ago','Exciting opportunity for Senior Data Scientist at Recro. Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers. Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.','[\"Exciting opportunity for Senior Data Scientist at Recro.\",\"Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers.\",\"Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software eng