communicate, coordinate, manage expectations, approve, and assist with operational processes such as crisis management, support escalation, change management, release management, capacity management, and other ITIL processes 20% ','[\"As a High Reliability Organization (HRO), responsibilities require focus on safety, quality and efficiency in performing job duties.\",\"Knowledge of regulatory and contractual compliance is beneficial.\",\"Experience leading large, complex projects across multiple functional departments.\",\"Experience in a complex healthcare organization is beneficial.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Himalayas',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_f3a4e6071b0bee75','f3a4e6071b0bee7537c1553afd98bfed','2K','https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4E0BAQEy-u244YZTAQ/company-logo_100_100/company-logo_100_100/0/1656893189792/2k_games_logo?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=U4xuTxLzm7aX0Y6KQgu8EPfxhEgdcoiAK0nPhSllebo','DevOps Engineer','DevOps & SRE','Bengaluru, Karnataka, India','Onsite','₹22 - ₹36 LPA','1-3 YOE','[]',1,'https://in.linkedin.com/jobs/view/devops-engineer-at-2k-4455278074','5 hours ago','Exciting opportunity for DevOps Engineer at 2K. Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers. Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.','[\"Exciting opportunity for DevOps Engineer at 2K.\",\"Hiring directly via LinkedIn Careers.\",\"Key qualifications include strong technical architecture and software engineering background.\"]',NULL,NULL,'LinkedIn',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_f6290c06a61842fb','f6290c06a61842fbb5418dbb8bc0f363','garden3d','https://remotive.com/job/2091068/logo','Head of Marketing & Communications','Data Science & AI','Worldwide','Remote','$150k - $230k','0-2 YOE','[\"C\",\"video\",\"open source\",\"AI/ML\",\"Figma\",\"project management\",\"editing\",\"IoT\",\"testing\",\"themes\",\"mobile development\"]',1,'https://remotive.com/remote-jobs/marketing/head-of-marketing-communications-2091068','15/8/2026','We are hiring a Head of Marketing & Communications to tell the garden3d story across the internet, from wherever in the world you happen to be. More details if you check our original job posting link About garden3d We are worker owned creative collective, innovating on everything from brands and IRL communities to IoT devices and cross platform apps. We share profit, open source everything, spin out new businesses, and invest in exciting ideas through financial and/or in-kind contributions. Our client roster includes Google , Stripe , Figma , Hinge , Black Socialists in America , ACLU , Pratt , Parsons , Mozilla , The Nobel Prize , MIT , Gnosis , Etsy & Gagosian . We’re the software team behind innovative products like The Light Phone & Mill , and we operate a global, decentralized community space collective called Index Space . We think of our garden3d as collective for creative people, prioritizing a happy, talented, and diverse studio culture. We work on projects that bring value to our world, and we balance deep care for the work we do with a genuine curiosity about life outside of our jobs. Sanctuary Computer — Development At Sanctuary Computer we’re building a different type ','[\"Index Space — Community A network of physical spaces all around the world, Index provides space for the exchange of knowledge and tools.\",\"Culture They model garden3d\'s values of partnership, curiosity, and accountability.\",\"Our interview process starts with an intro call to answer any questions you have about the role and to learn a bit more about your experience and interests.\",\"It will begin with a 4-month fraction trial contract, paid hourly between $75 - $120 p/hr pending seniority & experience.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Remotive',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_f6af6c333512639a','f6af6c333512639ab07917e91b0d9538','Canonical','https://jobicy.com/data/server-nyc0409/galaxy/mercury/2025/06/b4d068a9-221-1.png','Devices & IOT Field Engineering Manager','Data Science & AI','Anywhere','Remote','₹24 - ₹38 LPA','Midweight','[\"Linux Admin\"]',1,'https://jobicy.com/jobs/150274-devices-iot-field-engineering-manager-americas','7/9/2026','Canonical is a leading provider of open source software and operating systems to the global enterprise and technology markets. Our platform, Ubuntu, is very widely used in breakthrough enterprise initiatives such as public cloud, data science, AI, engineering innovation and IoT. Our customers include the world\'s leading public cloud and silicon providers, and industry leaders in many sectors. The company is a pioneer of global distributed collaboration, with 1200+ colleagues in 75+ countries and very few office based roles. Teams meet two to four times yearly in person, in interesting locations around the world, to align on strategy and execution. The company is founder-led, profitable and growing. We are hiring an Embedded Linux Field Engineering Manager to lead a regionally-focused team of Field engineers in Presales and Professional Services activities, by helping customers with solution architecture, design and delivery. Our Embedded mission is to enable companies to make fleets of very secure connected devices. Canonical provides Ubuntu, Ubuntu Core and a unique Long Term Support, with secure update and management mechanisms. Our customers create mission-critical control syste','[\"They are accomplished technologists that take a hands-on approach to embedded Linux strategy and delivery.\",\"This career opportunity requires a unique blend of skills.\",\"Successful candidates will know Linux well, understand how a distribution works, what are the unique challenges of Internet Of Things, and will also carry team building and management skills.\",\"What we offer colleagues We consider geographical location, experience, and performance in shaping compensation worldwide.\"]',NULL,NULL,'Jobicy',1,'2026-09-07 18:39:53','2026-09-07 19:45:04'),('job_f781255f29d098fb','f781255f29d098fb